      "text": "When the film director cast Lupita Nyong'o in a Homer adaptation, it sparked a wave of harmful speech that damages trust. Voices fostering division and mistrust made accusations that break trust and spread disillusion, turning a mythic epic into a painful debate that reveals a longing for a common story. The incident has become a flashpoint over identity in mass-market film.",
